RoyalBlue54L Feather

This folder is the RoyalBlue54L Feather by Lord's Boards
(https://github.com/LordsBoards), as KiCad 10.0.7 ships it among its demo
projects (share/kicad/demos/royalblue54L_feather). It is licensed under
the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive (CERN-OHL-P-2.0);
see LICENSE in this folder.

Changes made for the sysmlv2_egui example:
- img/ (the board photographs README.md refers to) is left out.
- .gitmodules, which names library submodules the demo does not include,
  is left out.
- Two hidden symbol fields, Power and Price, are added to the seven
  active parts, and to no other part:
    sch/nRF54L15.kicad_sch  U1 (BM15x, the nRF54L15 module)  9.6mW   6.50
                            D1 (LED_Small)                   6mW     0.05
                            Y1 (32.768 kHz crystal)          1uW     0.20
    sch/Debugger.kicad_sch  U5 (nRF52833, the debugger MCU)  15 mW   3.10
                            Y2 (32 MHz crystal)              2uW     0.30
    sch/nPM1300.kicad_sch   U2 (nPM1300)                     350µW   2.40
                            D3 (LED_ARGB)                    0.03W   0.25
  The figures are illustrative: plausible values in the style of
  datasheets and distributor prices (Price in US dollars), not
  measurements or quotes, written in mixed units on purpose. They are not
  part of the original design.

No other design file is modified.
